id: resolute-belief
name: Resolute Belief
kind: crafting
# A Special Apparel Quality: "typically gained through your ARC granting you unique pieces of
# Apparel".
special: true
slots: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Stress Bonus 2 higher.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Stress Bonus by 2.
text: >
  Resolute Belief: These clothes contribute to your morale, allowing you to draw on memories of
  the cause you fight for.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Stress Bonus by 2.

---

# The wearer's Stress Bonus, while worn - beside Team Outfit's, which is its own.
[passive]
stressBonus += 2;
